# --permission-mode dontAsk: not a ring member (internal/tui/app.go's
# permissionModeRing has only auto/manual/acceptEdits/plan), so
# cycleMode sends it straight to the ring's first entry, auto, rather
# than the next ring position after wherever dontAsk would sit. The
# design (Terminal.dc.html:222) only names three modes and has no
# "don't ask" entry at all — kiln's modeLabel (internal/tui/status.go)
# adds it for this CLI-only mode, so there is no design line to match
# it against here.
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@size 120x40
@args --permission-mode dontAsk

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT idle
EXPECT /don't ask/
KEY shift+tab
SHOT after-shift-tab
# dontAsk -> auto (not in the ring, so cycleMode goes to ring[0])
EXPECT /auto-edit/
EXPECT_NOT /don't ask/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
